description:
Design a 4-bit synchronous counter with a reset feature. The counter increments its value by one on every rising edge of the clock (CK). If the reset (RST) signal is asserted, the counter is set to zero. Otherwise, it continues counting up, allowing it to cycle through values from 0 to 15.
module top_module(
    input wire CK,
    input wire RST,
    output reg [3:0] Q
);

