Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build a 9-bit binary counter with synchronous active low reset signal and enable signal. When the enable signal is high, the counter increments by 2.
// (1) reset_n: Resets the counter to 9'b000000000 when low.
// (2) enable: Enables the counter to increment when high.
// (3) count: The current count value of the counter.

